{"id":14900,"author":"ClubberNugget","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eName: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:22.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;X-Files\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eGhast\r\nCreek\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eMap Author(s):\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:22.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eRandom_Guy\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eTeams: \u003cspan style=\"color:red\"\u003eRed\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#7030A0\"\u003ePurple\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#7F7F7F;mso-themecolor:background1;mso-themeshade:128;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:\r\n#7F7F7F;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:background1;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:\r\n100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:lumm=50000\"\u003eGrey\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan style=\"color:#0070C0\"\u003eBlue\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eHey guys, I have been gone\r\nfor a week because of a camping trip but now I’m back and I have a map I made before\r\nI left!\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eWelcome to the second indoor\r\nwalls map created; now this map is a little different from Vacuum when it comes\r\nto how it is indoors.\u0026nbsp; This map is Nether\r\nthemed, so there is a large dome to give the map a darker atmosphere; this is\r\nmy 3\u003csup\u003erd\u003c/sup\u003e walls map and my fourth finished map in general. \u0026nbsp;I hope you all find it fitting and ready for\r\nplay!\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wPMOY9y.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/wPMOY9y.png\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003e(An overview of the evil\r\nmap)\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/9dxTZrf.jpg\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/9dxTZrf.jpg\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003e(A View of a sector)\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/UY32u1z.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/UY32u1z.png\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eYou spawn underground,\r\nbeneath the surface, where you will find resources, weapons, a cave and much\r\nmore!!!\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/S7FwBGD.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/S7FwBGD.png\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 27.6000003814697px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eThere are also traps set on\r\nsurface, if you activate them, dispensers may summon some mean mobs.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eWell I hope you all like\r\nthis map and find it fitting, feedback is always appreciated!\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/qq8izbt4ciyu8vo/AACic_0nW-lN6qqYF31W7iZda?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eMap Download and YML\u003c/a\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:22.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot